omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYxYJZLDzhUQ7kNvwFv0E6E&_nc_oc=Adr3rViVJCVYBWB_832mugABIx3ww6SWetruiue8Ks6USv3gql30uwhbv4BeOdTVgi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB3uAI0-MYmLthYnGKNozpKP_qJItC3W1n5laCa3C7R4w&oe=6A6F2874"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XtUWmFBbVfsQ7kNvwFHy0xw&_nc_oc=AdpoZ04xdtr_C_Xp43zA83q2yti2iixHv073pHMZUCokz2xJ8-Qq-UiVfHZsI-zz-GY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDXO8ch0H0cxpwvwaDn29xwuOP02lK9ra_TzGTssgM3JA&oe=6A6F29D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k4Km1-5ACAMQ7kNvwFC48Wx&_nc_oc=AdoHjSSgAEalM74_ReF6hTpDk-iL-NRappb6qdGo6-xYkDU1AmIRWtrpUMbq3QxcKiE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAmsD64H1SDcIGiIyEr1ZC8NQoPMf2pHvHfyKcpLXXo0A&oe=6A6F3EF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://